{"title": "Deep Duerra", "pageid": 58623, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Deep_Duerra", "categories": ["Lore"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Deep Duerra</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Duergar\">duergar</a> goddess. She is referenced, but does not appear in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Although Deep Duerra cannot be encountered in the game, several item descriptions describe the flight of her <i>rebellious children</i>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Blade_Ring\" title=\"Shadow Blade Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Ring_D_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_D_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Ring_D_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_D_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Ring_D_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_D_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Ring_D_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_D_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Ring_D_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Blade_Ring\" title=\"Shadow Blade Ring\">Shadow Blade Ring</a></span> – <i>\"Long ago in a foreboding realm called Hammergrim, Deep Duerra, daughter of the dour god Laduguer, sired a great many heirs to her twisted corundum throne.\"</i></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eversight_Ring\" title=\"Eversight Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Eversight_Ring\" title=\"Eversight Ring\">Eversight Ring</a></span> – <i>\"Paranoid by nature, Duerra had erected a vast array of biting, blasting, blinding traps and safeguards to keep her enemies from gaining her sanctum. Of course, this also meant her children were sealed in with her by those same deadly measures.\"</i></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowstep_Boots\" title=\"Shadowstep Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Shadowstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shadowstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Shadowstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shadowstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Shadowstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shadowstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Shadowstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shadowstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/18/Shadowstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowstep_Boots\" title=\"Shadowstep Boots\">Shadowstep Boots</a></span> – <i>\"A mean-minded parent, Duerra quickly earned her children's enmity. In secret, the children devised a plan to escape their mother forever.\"</i></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hammergrim_Mist_Amulet\" title=\"Hammergrim Mist Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hammergrim_Mist_Amulet\" title=\"Hammergrim Mist Amulet\">Hammergrim Mist Amulet</a></span> – <i>\"Drugging the Keykeeper of Duerra's vaults, the children crept in under cover of night and plundered their mother's treasure - searching desperately for anything that would aid in their flight.\"</i></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume\" title=\"Cloak of Cunning Brume\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume\" title=\"Cloak of Cunning Brume\">Cloak of Cunning Brume</a></span> – <i>\"The children found nothing of use in the vault and were discouraged. But in the morning the Vault Keykeeper's son, who admired the children, sought them out - and in his arms he brought a wealth of things, forged in shadow.\"</i></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Penumbral_Armour\" title=\"Penumbral Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Penumbral_Armour\" title=\"Penumbral Armour\">Penumbral Armour</a></span> – <i>\"Kitted out though they were for escape, the older siblings had a horrible time encouraging their younger brothers and sisters, who at the crux were frightened of what their mother would do to them should they be caught.\"</i></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Covert_Cowl\" title=\"Covert Cowl\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b4/Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Covert_Cowl\" title=\"Covert Cowl\">Covert Cowl</a></span> – <i>\"Keeping themselves and one another safe from the nasty surprises of their home, the siblings made good progress. At the final hurdle, they were confronted by none other than Duerra herself, and her rage was great, and they felt the candles of hope in their hearts snuff out.\"</i></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadespell_Circlet\" title=\"The Shadespell Circlet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadespell_Circlet\" title=\"The Shadespell Circlet\">The Shadespell Circlet</a></span> – <i>\"Flanked by her court, Duerra shook her head at her children. Had they really believed they could leave her?\"</i></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Least_Expected\" title=\"Least Expected\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Least_Expected\" title=\"Least Expected\">Least Expected</a></span> – <i>\"It was to the tremendous surprise of all that Ludmilla, the quiet, the weepy, the daughter most under her mother's thumb, took up this bow and fired. The arrow flashed, and while Duerra and her blinded court wailed importantly, the children escaped into an uncertain, yet sweetly free, future.\"</i></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Deep_Duerra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deep Duerra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Deep_Duerra\">Deep Duerra</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202848\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visi